=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to the {n:Suspicious Hume} in {z:Pashhow Marshlands} (E-12).
** Take either the {p:Voidwatch Warp|Atmacite Refiner} or {p:Unity Warp} 122 - Pashhow Marshlands.
* He will ask you to acquire one of three items: {i:Rabbit Hide|Rabbit Hide|856}, {i:Lizard Tail|Lizard Tail|926}, or {i:Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud|Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud|4368}.
** Bog Bunnies are just north of the Hume drop the Rabbit Hide.
* Procure one of the items and trade it to any of the following NPCs: {br}{n:Suspicious Tarutaru} in {z:Port Windurst} (M-4) near Home Point #3 (M).{br} {n:Suspicious Elvaan} in {z:Northern San d'Oria} (L-8) near Home Point #3 (M).{br} {n:Suspicious Galka} in {z:Port Bastok} (K-12) near Home Point #2 (M).
* After a brief cutscene you are given the {@k} {k:Ring of supernal disjunction}.
* Examine the Odyssean Passage and enter to receive a cutscene completing the quest.
* To obtain {@k} {k:Gladiatorial writ of summons} for the quest {q:The Curious Case of Melvien|The Curious Case of Melvien|The Curious Case of Melvien}, speak to Suspicious Tarutaru, Suspicious Elvaan or Suspicious Galka. Select "Belligerency", exit the menu talk to them again and select the key item.
** If you're only doing this for Mog Garden/Monster Rearing make sure you talk to the NPC again and return the writ or you will be put in belligerency state in the applicable zones.

